{"seq":3,"slug":"digital-twin","title":"数字孪生技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/robotics-automation/ros-and-middleware/robot-simulation/digital-twin","wordCount":632,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"数字孪生技术\">数字孪生技术</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>数字孪生（Digital Twin）是物理机器人系统在虚拟空间中的高保真动态映射。与传统仿真不同，数字孪生强调物理实体和虚拟模型之间的实时数据同步——物理世界的状态变化实时反映到虚拟模型，虚拟空间的优化决策实时反馈到物理控制。数字孪生是工业 4.0 和智能制造的核心技术之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[物理机器人] --&gt;|传感器数据| B[数据采集层]&#10;    B --&gt;|实时同步| C[数字孪生模型]&#10;    C --&gt;|仿真预测| D[决策引擎]&#10;    D --&gt;|控制指令| A&#10;    C --&gt; E[3D 可视化]&#10;    C --&gt; F[历史回放]&#10;    C --&gt; G[故障预测]\">graph LR\n    A[物理机器人] --&gt;|传感器数据| B[数据采集层]\n    B --&gt;|实时同步| C[数字孪生模型]\n    C --&gt;|仿真预测| D[决策引擎]\n    D --&gt;|控制指令| A\n    C --&gt; E[3D 可视化]\n    C --&gt; F[历史回放]\n    C --&gt; G[故障预测]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>数字孪生层级</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n<th>数据流向</th>\n<th>应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数字模型</td>\n<td>静态几何+物理参数</td>\n<td>无实时连接</td>\n<td>设计验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字影子</td>\n<td>单向数据同步</td>\n<td>物理→虚拟</td>\n<td>监控诊断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数字孪生</td>\n<td>双向数据同步</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>自适应控制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据同步架构\">数据同步架构</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import asyncio&#10;import websockets&#10;import json&#10;from dataclasses import dataclass, asdict&#10;&#10;@dataclass&#10;class RobotState:&#10;    joint_positions: list&#10;    joint_velocities: list&#10;    end_effector_pose: list&#10;    force_torque: list&#10;    timestamp: float&#10;&#10;class DigitalTwinSync:&#10;    def __init__(self, physical_robot, virtual_model, sync_rate=100):&#10;        self.physical = physical_robot&#10;        self.virtual = virtual_model&#10;        self.sync_rate = sync_rate&#10;        self.state_history = []&#10;&#10;    async def sync_loop(self):&#10;        while True:&#10;            state = self.physical.get_state()&#10;            self.virtual.update_state(state)&#10;&#10;            prediction = self.virtual.predict_next_state()&#10;            anomaly = self.detect_anomaly(state, prediction)&#10;&#10;            if anomaly:&#10;                self.trigger_alert(state, prediction)&#10;&#10;            self.state_history.append(state)&#10;            await asyncio.sleep(1.0 / self.sync_rate)&#10;&#10;    def detect_anomaly(self, actual, predicted, threshold=0.1):&#10;        error = sum(&#10;            (a - p) ** 2&#10;            for a, p in zip(actual.joint_positions, predicted.joint_positions)&#10;        ) ** 0.5&#10;        return error &gt; threshold\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> asyncio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> websockets</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclasses </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dataclass, asdict</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">@dataclass</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> RobotState</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#